# slug: ch75-worker
# source: chapters/ch75.tex:158
# label: alg:ch75-worker
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch75.tex:161
# caption: Accept a worker completion only for one live request in the current session.

REQUIRE framed completion, current session, serialized request-table access
ENSURE at most one terminal completion per admitted request
validate frame extent, session identity, request ID, and result schema
IF request is absent or already terminal THEN
  reject duplicate or stale reply
END IF
atomically mark request terminal and detach its retained resources
deliver its outcome through a protected host-runtime entry
release detached resources exactly once

